jmp main
fl:
ln! drop
ln@ "," split c!
c@ 2 get region!
c@ 3 get country!
c@ 4 get product!
c@ 7 get bparse units!
c@ 10 get fparse total!
tr@ total@ + tr!
tu@ units@ + tu!
rr@ region@ getq 0 + rv!
rr@ region@ rv@ total@ + set
pr@ product@ getq 0 + pv!
pr@ product@ pv@ total@ + set
cr@ country@ getq 0 + cv!
cr@ country@ cv@ total@ + set
rows@ 1 + rows!
0 ret
bparse:
s!
0 result!
0 bi!
s@ 0 get ch!
'bpc 'bpb while drop
result@ ret
bpc:
ch@ 48 lt jz bpc2
0 ret
bpc2:
ch@ 57 gt jz bpc3
0 ret
bpc3:
1 ret
bpb:
result@ 10 * ch@ 48 - + result!
bi@ 1 + bi!
s@ bi@ get ch!
0 ret
fparse:
s!
s@ "." find dot!
s@ 0 dot@ slice intpart!
intpart@ bparse whole!
dot@ 1 + s@ len dot@ 1 + - slice fracpart!
fracpart@ 0 get f0!
fracpart@ 1 get f1!
f0@ 48 - 10 fracpart@ 2 get 48 - + fracpart@ 3 get 48 - 0.01 * + + fracval!
whole@ fracval@ + ret
emit:
d! items! n!
0 idx!
items@ len 'elf for
elf:
k!
items@ k@ get name!
d@ name@ getq val!
idx@ n@ lt 'em if
idx@ 1 + idx!
0 ret
em:
name@ val@ "%s $%.2f\n" print drop
idx@ 1 + idx!
0 ret
main:
0 tr! 0 tu! 0 rows!
dict rr!
dict pr!
dict cr!
argv len 1 gt jz usedefault
argv 1 get p!
jmp go
usedefault:
"bench/data/sales.csv" p!
go:
p@ 0 'fl ffold drop
"=== DATA ANALYTICS RESULTS ===\n" print drop
rows@ "total_rows: %d\n" print
tr@ "total_revenue: %.2f\n" print
tr@ rows@ div "avg_order: %.2f\n" print
tu@ "total_units: %d\n" print
rr@ keys rk!
rk@ sort rk!
rr@ rk@ 6 'emit drop
pr@ keys pk!
pk@ sort pk!
pr@ pk@ 5 'emit drop
cr@ keys ck!
ck@ sort ck!
cr@ ck@ 3 'emit drop
